WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.850
- Kelly Clarkson show always
closes out with one last story

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.480
to kind of brighten your day.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.866
So here it goes, "This
is what I'm liking".

00:00:06.866 --> 00:00:09.760
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:12.080
A third grade teacher in Georgia
wanted to give the students

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.110
a little extra motivation to work hard

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.660
and to be good to one another.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.880
So he promised if they gave
their all to this studies

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.220
and stayed out of trouble,

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.970
he'd give them each a very
special Christmas gift.

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:22.965
When the holidays rolled around,

00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:24.500
he'd delivered big time,

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.650
giving each kid a brand new
pair of designer sneakers.

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.310
So we have this very cool
educator on the line right now.

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:31.143
Let's talk to him.

00:00:31.143 --> 00:00:33.147
Hi Anthony, how are ya?

00:00:33.147 --> 00:00:34.771
- Hey, how y'all doing everybody?

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:36.120
Nice to meet ya all.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:36.953
- [Jay] Good to see you.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:37.850
So why did you do this?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.960
Well, I kind of know, but go ahead.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:41.180
- Why did I do it?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.200
While I was in college, I had a professor

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:46.210
named Dr. Wethertine that
always taught us to be the one.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.904
And so I wanted to do something
different for my kids,

00:00:47.904 --> 00:00:49.299
if they put in the work.

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.021
So I told my kids from
the first day of school,

00:00:51.021 --> 00:00:52.811
you come in, apply pressure.

00:00:52.811 --> 00:00:55.680
You show growth in the different studies

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:58.240
that we have in our classroom,
also the different programs,

00:00:58.240 --> 00:00:59.330
I'll reward you.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.326
But the big kicker was the big three.

00:01:01.326 --> 00:01:04.130
Be ready, be respectful, be responsible.

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:07.130
And so no suspensions, no
detentions, no bullying,

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:09.310
but also showing respect
amongst other adults,

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:11.700
not just myself, even
though I'm not watching.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.256
So literally they had
to work all year long

00:01:13.256 --> 00:01:14.471
and they showed the work.

00:01:14.471 --> 00:01:17.076
They applied pressure and so
feel its right to reward them

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:18.370
with the shoes.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:19.203
- [Jay] Well, that's terrific.

00:01:19.203 --> 00:01:20.036
Were the kids-

00:01:20.036 --> 00:01:21.593
Were they shocked when
they saw their sneaker.

00:01:21.593 --> 00:01:23.110
Look at that.

00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:24.530
- Shocked is a understatement.

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:27.980
So the way I did it is,
I would go to the mall

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:29.810
and take pictures of random shoes.

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.290
And so I had already wrote down,

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.550
their different shoe sizes

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.720
and I would come back in and I say,

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:34.553
well look.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.386
I'd go to each kid, and I say,

00:01:35.386 --> 00:01:37.127
let me pick out these shoes
for my niece and my nephew.

00:01:37.127 --> 00:01:38.931
And so they'll look at
the shoes and they'll say

00:01:38.931 --> 00:01:40.455
either they liked them or they didn't.

00:01:40.455 --> 00:01:41.680
And I said, all right.

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:43.011
So if I bought this shoe,

00:01:43.011 --> 00:01:43.950
would you wear them?

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:45.231
Will my niece and nephew like them?

00:01:45.231 --> 00:01:47.146
And they say yes, then I would go with it.

00:01:47.146 --> 00:01:48.730
If they said no, then I wouldn't,

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.150
and I would go back to the drawing board.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:51.600
So the day they open their shoe boxes,

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.650
they was like, Mr. K,
these the shoes I picked.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:54.483
it's my size.

00:01:54.483 --> 00:01:57.626
And they take pride on them by
wearing the shoes at school.

00:01:57.626 --> 00:01:59.050
And that's the big thing for me.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:00.810
I don't want to buy them
anything they didn't like,

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:02.190
but also something that they took pride in

00:02:02.190 --> 00:02:05.850
and they enjoy to see, and they
wear them almost every day.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:06.970
So, but it wasn't all on me.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:08.080
It was a teamwork effort.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.010
- [Jay] You know, I'm here
because I had great teachers

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:12.013
like you when I was a kid.

00:02:12.013 --> 00:02:13.900
I had a teacher that said,
"Hey, you should think about

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:14.920
being a comedy writer."

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.050
It never occurred to me

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:18.410
until the teacher gave me
that impetus, you know?

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:19.600
So thank you my friend.

00:02:19.600 --> 00:02:20.433
Thank you from me,

00:02:20.433 --> 00:02:22.154
and thank you for all the others as well.

00:02:22.154 --> 00:02:23.850
- My pleasure.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.450
- I'm liking your post right now

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:27.713
and that's not all.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.610
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.840
makers of the friction go-to erasable pen

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:33.768
of the Kelly Clarkson
Show wants to celebrate

00:02:33.768 --> 00:02:36.470
those creating
fearlessness, just like you.

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:39.010
So they're giving you a check for $1,000.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:41.230
So thank you my friend, thanks a lot.

00:02:41.230 --> 00:02:42.370
- Wow.
- There you go,

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.270
You got 'em buddy.

